      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "A jovial acolyte stands at the lobby of the Sith wing of the Twilight Praxeum, pleased to greet those new aspirants or other acolytes who are coming to seek their first step upon the long road of becoming Sith...",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00009",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00005",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00001",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00000",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00001": {
      "Id": "entry-00001",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "\"And I want to be a pretty princess from Onderon. Hah, no, just joking. It's simple enough. We want our aspirants to be minimally competent. Find someone willing to vouch for you and lead you down - not me! - to the underlevels, and complete the Aspirant's Trial, and you shall become an aspirant.\"",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00002",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00002": {
      "Id": "entry-00002",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "\"It's a small maze. You must venture alone within, and slaughter the mynocks that dwell there, until enough carnage had bloodied you to the satisfaction of your betters and you have proven some minimal competence. Or something like that. We will tell you what to do next. Oh, uh. Don't die? Or die. I don't really care. Good luck, and may the Force serve you.\"",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00004",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00003",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00003": {
      "Id": "entry-00003",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "\"Okay. Well. When I first discovered that I was Sensitive, I thought, hey, I should strike out of my own. Hated the Jedi, smug little arrogant karks that they are, though eh, reasons for the hate's my own, yea? That aside, turns out that learning alone is hard. Very hard. The Jedi, the Revanites, and Malak's band of sycophants all go around trawling about the dirt, taking all the nice holocrons and ancient texts or whatever and hoarding them. A gal by myself ain't having it an easy time learning anything at all. Couldn't even come close to forging a lightsaber. Then, I ran into Lord Arrelac, and, well. The rest was history.\"",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00007",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00006",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00004": {
      "Id": "entry-00004",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "\"Yea. You think they just put up the blueprint everywhere, hm? Maybe tell you what you need on the HoloNet? No! I didn't even know what a 'Kyber Crystal' was until Lord Arrelac told me. Oh, huh, maybe I shouldn't have told you that, but, well, trying to find one is almost as hard as trying to get a bar of beskar...\"",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00008",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00005": {
      "Id": "entry-00005",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "\"Name's Lenari. Lenari Ruun. I am Lord Arrelac's apprentice, and I spend most of my time outside of my training dealing with the horde of scrambling incompetents who want to join the Revanite Order. Half of them think that because they are Sensitive to the Force, therefore they are special, or better than everyone else. Meh.\"",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00010",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    }
  },
